		{
			"id": 7509406,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7509406
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7509406",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7509406,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750940601,
					"content": "呼——嚇死我了，突然就有怪物襲擊過來，還好我們夠厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940602,
						750940604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940602,
					"content": "那下次就拜託派蒙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940603,
					"content": "啊？不行不行不行，我不行的！我才不要跟那麼可怕的怪物戰鬥！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940606,
					"content": "呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940607,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}看小傢伙都著急了，我們還是先想辦法孵化龍蛋吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940608,
					"content": "啟動孵化器。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940609,
					"content": "孵化器恢復運作…\\n接下來需要做的似乎只有等待…\\n然而，時間過去了很久…龍蛋沒有發生任何變化，一絲一毫都沒有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940610,
					"content": "嗯…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940611,
					"content": "好奇怪，感覺好像沒有任何反應欸？難道是我們的操作有問題嗎？我們再試一遍好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940612,
						750940632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940612,
					"content": "再試一遍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940613,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們按照說明重新啟動了孵化器…\\n但跟之前一樣，龍蛋上依舊沒有出現任何變化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940614
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940614,
					"content": "嗚…到底還要等多久啊，我覺得我的眼睛都快花掉了…頭也好暈…肚子也好餓…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940615,
					"content": "嗚…咕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940616,
					"content": "欸？！欸？！等等！牠好像動了一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940617,
						750940627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940617,
					"content": "那還是再等一下…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940618
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940618,
					"content": "又經過了一段漫長的時間…\\n龍蛋仍然一切如故，沒有任何的反應，更沒有任何即將要破殼而出的跡象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940619,
					"content": "還是沒有反應…不會是孵化器壞了吧…可是明明都亮起來了！難道問題出在龍蛋上？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940620,
					"content": "唔——感覺再這樣等下去也不是辦法…要不然我們把龍蛋帶走吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940621,
						750940624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940621,
					"content": "再餓也不能想著吃龍蛋哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940622,
					"content": "哇！哇！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940623,
					"content": "#才不會吃勒！不要讓{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}產生奇怪的誤解啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940626,
					"content": "小傢伙，我的意思是說，如果問題真的出在龍蛋身上的話，那這顆龍蛋可能永遠都…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940634,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940635,
					"content": "#不要傷心，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，這也是沒有辦法的事情…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940636,
						750940637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940636,
					"content": "或許，只是這裡的環境不適合…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940638,
					"content": "說、說得對！孵不出來可能是因為龍蛋覺得現在的納塔和以前一樣，不適合當牠的家！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940639,
					"content": "畢竟牠一直藏在這裡，根本不可能知道外面已經變得多棒了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940640,
					"content": "那我們把牠帶回去好好照顧吧！每天都講故事給牠聽！講漂亮的風景、精彩的冒險、還有那些很好很好的人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940641,
					"content": "總而言之，告訴牠現在的納塔有多棒！等牠心動了，一定會自己主動破殼而出的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940642,
					"content": "…啵嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940637,
					"content": "或許，是牠認為還不是時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940624,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，你怎麼看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940625
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940625,
					"content": "嗯…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940627,
					"content": "根本沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940628,
					"content": "#欸？！可是…剛才明明…難道是我的錯覺？不對，不對，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，你剛才看到了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940629,
					"content": "嗯…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940630,
					"content": "#啊…小傢伙也沒看到？難道真的只是我的錯覺而已？那怎麼辦，{NICKNAME}，我們還要繼續等下去嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940631,
					"content": "還是說…問題出在龍蛋上？可、可是如果問題真的出在龍蛋上，那不就意味著永遠孵不出來了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940632,
					"content": "問題應該出在龍蛋上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940633
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940633,
					"content": "啊？那、那就是說，這顆龍蛋有可能永遠都孵不出來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750940604,
					"content": "哼，不過如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750940605,
					"content": "就是嘛！張牙舞爪的，我還以為是什麼特別厲害的角色！結果就這點攻擊，還沒有小傢伙撞人痛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750940606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7512606,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7509402
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7509402",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7509402,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							229.674,
							237.95,
							9642.107
						],
						"pointId": 9945
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751260601,
					"content": "沒想到還有發生過這樣的事…密力奇，還有留下這篇筆記的人，大家真的都好勇敢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260602,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260603,
					"content": "這個是…是剛才手記裡提到的那顆休眠的龍蛋！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260604,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，你是想要我們用孵化器孵出來嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260605,
					"content": "呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260606,
					"content": "#唔——龍蛋看起來狀態滿不錯的，孵化器上剛好也有操作指南，{NICKNAME}，我們乾脆試試看怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260607,
						751260608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751260607,
					"content": "雖然不知道行不行，但值得一試。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751260609
					]
